2. **Gevherhan Sultan (daughter of Selim II)**: She was an Ottoman princess, daughter of Sultan Selim II and Nurbanu Sultan. She was the granddaughter of Suleiman the Magnificent and Hürrem Sultan. She was part of the triple wedding celebrated by Suleiman in 1562.

3. **Gevherhan Hatun**: She was an Ottoman princess, daughter of Sultan Mehmed the Conqueror and his wife Empress Emine Gülbahar Hatun. She was the sister of Sultan Bayezid II and the half-sister of Cem Sultan.

